{"id": "claim-term-counts-raw", "hash": "e4fe66a82232", "nhash": "96122bceea3d", "ts": "2026-06-10T18:44:22+00:00", "type": "data+interpretation", "claim": "Term layers['counts'] contains genuine raw integer UMI counts (min=0, max_nonzero=3309, frac_noninteger=0) whereas term X is log-normalized (frac_noninteger=0.9998, has_negative=False) and equals layers['log1pM'] (max abs diff 0 on the first 2000 cells).", "interpretation": "Term provides recoverable raw counts suitable for re-normalization or pseudobulk; X is already log1p-normalized.", "numbers": {"n_slice": 2000, "counts_min": 0.0, "counts_max_nonzero": 3309.0, "counts_frac_noninteger": 0.0, "counts_has_negative": 0, "X_frac_noninteger": 0.9998318808954418, "X_has_negative": 0, "X_vs_log1pM_maxdiff": 0.0}, "checks": [{"id": "tm-counts-int", "kind": "equal", "values": ["counts_frac_noninteger", 0.0], "tol": 0}, {"id": "tm-counts-nonneg", "kind": "bounds", "values": ["counts_min"], "lo": 0}, {"id": "tm-counts-no-neg", "kind": "equal", "values": ["counts_has_negative", 0], "tol": 0}, {"id": "tm-X-noninteger", "kind": "bounds", "values": ["X_frac_noninteger"], "lo": 1e-06, "hi": 1.0}, {"id": "tm-X-no-neg", "kind": "equal", "values": ["X_has_negative", 0], "tol": 0}, {"id": "tm-X-eq-log1pM", "kind": "bounds", "values": ["X_vs_log1pM_maxdiff"], "lo": 0, "hi": 0.001}], "source": "/mnt/run/jh/projects/tes_agent/term_final.h5ad", "inputs": [{"path": "/mnt/run/jh/projects/tes_agent/term_final.h5ad", "sha256": "888e0acd8a80c5de88a09bb2db3a69df60d94afa0019bb1e4202363842c8a0d3"}], "outputs": [{"path": "/mnt/run/jh/projects/tes_agent/results/step-2_datastate.csv"}], "search_terms": ["raw UMI counts log1p normalization scRNA-seq", "anndata layers counts log-normalized X"]}
{"id": "claim-ft-counts-not-raw", "hash": "40c9d6b4377f", "nhash": "120fc54dfe67", "ts": "2026-06-10T18:44:22+00:00", "type": "data+interpretation", "claim": "First trimester has NO genuine raw counts: X (frac_noninteger=0.9999), layers['counts'] (frac_noninteger=0.9999, min=0) and raw.X (frac_noninteger=0.9999) are all non-integer and non-negative; raw.X equals X on the shared 5000 HVG (max abs diff 0). So the 'counts' layer is misnamed relative to term.", "interpretation": "Pseudobulk/DE that assumes integer counts cannot be done directly on first trimester; the two datasets are NOT symmetric in available raw data, a key caveat for any cross-dataset quantitative comparison.", "numbers": {"n_slice": 2000, "X_frac_noninteger": 0.9998769991345481, "X_has_negative": 0, "counts_frac_noninteger": 0.999879963010824, "counts_min": 0.0, "counts_has_negative": 0, "rawX_frac_noninteger": 0.9999193892932859, "rawX_has_negative": 0, "rawX_vs_X_maxdiff": 0.0, "n_shared_x_raw": 5000, "term_counts_frac_noninteger": 0.0}, "checks": [{"id": "ft-counts-noninteger", "kind": "bounds", "values": ["counts_frac_noninteger"], "lo": 1e-06, "hi": 1.0}, {"id": "ft-X-noninteger", "kind": "bounds", "values": ["X_frac_noninteger"], "lo": 1e-06, "hi": 1.0}, {"id": "ft-rawX-noninteger", "kind": "bounds", "values": ["rawX_frac_noninteger"], "lo": 1e-06, "hi": 1.0}, {"id": "ft-X-no-neg", "kind": "equal", "values": ["X_has_negative", 0], "tol": 0}, {"id": "ft-counts-no-neg", "kind": "equal", "values": ["counts_has_negative", 0], "tol": 0}, {"id": "ft-rawX-no-neg", "kind": "equal", "values": ["rawX_has_negative", 0], "tol": 0}, {"id": "ft-rawX-eq-X", "kind": "bounds", "values": ["rawX_vs_X_maxdiff"], "lo": 0, "hi": 0.001}, {"id": "asymmetry-term-int-ft-not", "kind": "equal", "values": ["term_counts_frac_noninteger", 0.0], "tol": 0}], "source": "/mnt/run/jh/projects/tes_agent/first_trimester_final.h5ad", "inputs": [{"path": "/mnt/run/jh/projects/tes_agent/first_trimester_final.h5ad", "sha256": "85b091